   "text": "Manchester School of Architecture - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nManchester School of Architecture\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nManchester school of architecture is an innovative collaboration between Manchester Metropolitan University and the University of Manchester. In our creative community, there are over 300 international students, from more than 50 countries, working with specialist academic staff from across the world in the heart of a vibrant and multicultural city. Our alumni and industry links spread across the globe, and offer our students opportunities to work with international partners, and develop exciting careers whether that’s in Manchester or further afield.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n22/04/2026 07:27\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n22/04/2026 07:27\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £26,000.00\nMin: £25,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n2%\n10 of 500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1996\nCampus(es)\nManchester\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n13/10/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mfZeBv1bqpc\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
